    {
      "id": "cr_a4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "type": "event",
      "kind": "disappearance",
      "name": "The tender that stopped calling",
      "summary": "A survey tender stopped answering the Lantern on its way out.",
      "details": "A tender left the Lantern for the far side of the Verge and called in on schedule twice. Then it stopped. The Lantern logged an arrival at the same hour the tender went quiet. Secret: the arrival is the tender, which came back without its crew and drifts in a parking orbit.",
